    "description": "What is the most boring thing that defines your character?⁣⁣\nNijayathi ga undatam. ⁣⁣\n⁣⁣\nNuvu enni aina cheppu babai, nijayathi tho nilakada ga  nilapadalenodu, puja ki paniki raani puvu lantodu, chudataniki entha bauna waste ae.⁣⁣\n⁣⁣\nAlage nuvu entha andhanga unna, entha dabbu unna, nijayathi ni, nee bujalu meedha yeskoni moyyalekhapothe, nee character ni china phone lo photo theesina chendalangane untundhi. ⁣⁣\n⁣⁣\n'Veyya abaddhaalu aadaina pelli cheyamannaru' mari dhaniki em antav ra ante, abadhaalatho modhalu pette ye bandhamaina, entha gatti cement yesi kattina, yedho oka roju koolipodhi. Malli adhe bandhaaniki bangala kattali ante boledu time pattuddhi.⁣⁣\n⁣⁣\nAina abaddhaalu aadataniki enni samethalu kanipettina, venakanesukoni samaadhi cheyali anukuna, aa samasya barinchaleni bhayam la matrame tayaru avuddhi. ⁣⁣\n⁣⁣\nAdhe nijayathi valla gudisa lo discomfort ga una, padukunetapudu peeda kalalu raakunda untai. 'Oo nijayathi ani pathithu kathalu padthav endhi' ante nijayathi ga unte super power lu em ocheyvu saami. Just 72 times correct ga gunde ela kottukovalo ala kottukuntundhi. Bhayam lekunda, dhairyanga, naralu annitiki poushtika aahaaram ela velalo ala velthundhi.⁣\n⁣\nPlus entante, yekuva rojulu balanga bathukuthav, yevadunna lekhapoyina. Ilanti vishyaallo minus'lu gurinchi memory allocate cheyatam waste. ⁣⁣\n⁣⁣\nNee chaavu ki, nuvu nijayathi tho sampadinchukune vaalu matrame ostharu, mostharu. Abaddhaalatho palakarinche vaalu just dhuram nunchi chustharu.⁣⁣\n⁣⁣\nMoral: 'Neelo nijayathi ni chusi hi cheppe akarshanaki, ayyushu yekuva.' ⁣⁣\n⁣⁣\nP.S 1: 'Enni andhamaina puvvu'lu unai, anni puja vaadaru ga, so your statement is wrong, malli raskonra' ani subject raani ameerpet lo trainer la behave cheyaku. Cheppina point ki markulu yeyyi anthe kani gallo dosalu yeyaku.⁣⁣\n⁣⁣\nP.S 2: '72 times kottukovali ani rule ledhu ga' ante 60-100 madyalo undali annaru. But 72 aithe rich ga untundhi, ammai lu impress ipotharu ane feeling tho pettenu anamata.'⁣⁣\n⁣⁣\nYours insincerely, ⁣⁣\nFM.",
